Subject: [PATCH] apple-ibridge: defer USB configuration changes during HID probe

Avoid synchronous USB reconfiguration during HID probing, which can
deadlock when the USB core disconnects the interface being probed.

Upstream-Status: Pending

diff --git a/apple-ibridge.c b/apple-ibridge.c
index 4b1d628..c501606 100644
--- a/apple-ibridge.c
+++ b/apple-ibridge.c
@@ -239,7 +239,7 @@ int apple_ib_set_tb_mode(struct usb_device *udev, enum tb_mode mode)
 	dev_info(&udev->dev, "MBP14,3: switching Touch Bar to cfg=%d (%s)\n",
 		 target_cv, (target_cv == dcv) ? "display" : "keyboard");
 
-	ret = usb_set_configuration(udev, target_cv);
+	ret = usb_driver_set_configuration(udev, target_cv);
 	if (ret)
 		dev_err(&udev->dev, "MBP14,3: usb_set_configuration(%d) failed: %d\n",
 			target_cv, ret);
